Without a language file mormiCommander is in English. Hungarian comes built in: set the interface language to hu. A language file of your own (.lng lines "English\=Translation", or .json) goes in the settings folder; texts it lacks stay English. Translated so far: the menus (on macOS the system's own too), the function key bar, the status line, the column headers, the Options dialog, the job windows, Find files, Multi-Rename, Synchronize folders, the most common dialogs and many messages.=
